   "speech": "First handle: Peekaboo. Can a model that was only trained to make pictures tell you where things are? I give you this photo and the words \"Harry Potter\", and I want a mask of just Harry. Normally you'd train a segmentation network on hand-labeled masks. Peekaboo does no training of its own. It optimizes a mask against frozen, off-the-shelf Stable Diffusion, one image at a time."
  },
