   "speech": "This is a picture of Harry Potter. Paste Harry on red, still Harry Potter. Green, black, white, blue: they're ALL Harry Potter. The background doesn't matter. So I want the mask where any background swap still reads as \"Harry Potter\" to the diffusion model."
  },
  {
